; GraphEdit showing its zoom label, the one `show_*` flag that defaults off (graph_edit.h:192).
; The label is a 48*scale-wide Label at the head of the toolbar row, showing `round(zoom * 100)%`
; (graph_edit.cpp:2620-2624). It widens the panel by a column no sibling fixture has, and is the
; only place the zoom value reaches a still frame.

